WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:02.227
The Mighty Man actor frowned.

2
00:00:02.228 --> 00:00:05.688
"Everyone's calling me Slime Guy!"

3
00:00:05.689 --> 00:00:08.370
"How do you know?" Roxy asked.

4
00:00:08.371 --> 00:00:11.266
"People are making Clocktime videos about it.

5
00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:14.810
There's even a dumb Slime Guy dance!"

6
00:00:14.811 --> 00:00:16.410
The actor sighed.

7
00:00:16.411 --> 00:00:20.574
"Why can't I have cool super powers like you?"

8
00:00:20.575 --> 00:00:24.293
"I didn't choose my super powers." Roxy shrugged.

9
00:00:24.294 --> 00:00:26.927
"Sometimes I don't like my super strength."

10
00:00:26.928 --> 00:00:30.591
The actor raised an eyebrow. "You don't?"

11
00:00:30.592 --> 00:00:34.328
Roxy shook her head. "I always have to be careful.

12
00:00:34.329 --> 00:00:37.264
I might break stuff—or hurt someone.

13
00:00:37.265 --> 00:00:41.628
But my super powers let me help people. So that's good."

14
00:00:41.629 --> 00:00:46.294
Dr. Chen walked over. "Private Benson? Is that you?"

15
00:00:46.295 --> 00:00:51.849
Private Benson nodded. "I think Old Misty did this to me."

16
00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:55.903
"Someone's trying to control our minds too," Roxy said.

17
00:00:55.904 --> 00:00:58.158
"I have to find out who it is."

18
00:00:58.159 --> 00:00:59.872
Dr. Chen shook her head.

19
00:00:59.873 --> 00:01:03.003
"Old Misty's energy is causing problems.

20
00:01:03.004 --> 00:01:05.408
But I'm working on a cure."

21
00:01:05.409 --> 00:01:10.798
The actor smiled. "Good! I don't want to be a real superhero."

22
00:01:10.799 --> 00:01:12.762
Roxy's shoulders slumped.

23
00:01:12.763 --> 00:01:14.412
Her plan was failing.

24
00:01:14.413 --> 00:01:18.542
She was still Metro City's only superhero.

25
00:01:18.543 --> 00:01:20.943
General Waltz walked in.

26
00:01:20.944 --> 00:01:24.336
"Private Benson? What happened to you?"

27
00:01:24.337 --> 00:01:28.266
Private Benson told him her story.

28
00:01:28.267 --> 00:01:32.800
The general tapped his chin. "Very odd."

29
00:01:32.801 --> 00:01:36.031
Dr. Chen looked at Private Benson and the Mighty Man actor.

30
00:01:36.032 --> 00:01:37.616
"I don't know why.

31
00:01:37.617 --> 00:01:41.777
But the geyser's energy affected only you two.

32
00:01:41.778 --> 00:01:43.478
And the skunk."

33
00:01:43.479 --> 00:01:48.596
"Everyone's talking about that skunk on Friendbook!" the Mighty Man actor said.

34
00:01:48.597 --> 00:01:55.992
Dr. Chen looked at Private Benson. "I should run some tests on you."

35
00:01:55.993 --> 00:01:59.977
Roxy removed the steel pole from Private Benson.

36
00:01:59.978 --> 00:02:04.517
Right away Private Benson knocked Roxy into the wall.

37
00:02:04.518 --> 00:02:06.963
Then she smashed a computer.

38
00:02:06.964 --> 00:02:10.698
"I'm Rumbler!" she shouted.

39
00:02:10.699 --> 00:02:14.724
"Ahh!" The Mighty Man actor hid.

40
00:02:14.725 --> 00:02:17.501
A puddle of slime formed on the floor.

41
00:02:17.502 --> 00:02:19.521
Roxy made a fist.

42
00:02:19.522 --> 00:02:22.458
Bam! Private Benson stumbled back.

43
00:02:22.459 --> 00:02:26.311
Roxy flew into her, pushing her into a large cell.

44
00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:32.360
The private calmed down. "The voice . . . It controlled me again!"

45
00:02:32.361 --> 00:02:34.430
Roxy looked around the cell.

46
00:02:34.431 --> 00:02:36.581
"This room is made of steel.

47
00:02:36.582 --> 00:02:38.843
I think you should stay in here."

48
00:02:38.844 --> 00:02:42.732
Private Benson nodded.

49
00:02:42.733 --> 00:02:46.690
Dr. Chen seemed busy with her device.

50
00:02:46.691 --> 00:02:50.872
General Waltz smiled. "Good work, Rocket Girl!"

51
00:02:50.873 --> 00:02:55.713
"No problem, General." Roxy looked at her watch and smiled.

52
00:02:55.714 --> 00:03:00.590
She still had time to meet her friends.

53
00:03:00.591 --> 00:03:08.090
When Roxy reached Metro City Mall, her watch beeped.

54
00:03:08.091 --> 00:03:12.276
"Mayor Bloom," she said. "What's wrong now?"

55
00:03:12.277 --> 00:03:16.648
"There's an emergency at the old canning factory," the mayor said.

56
00:03:16.649 --> 00:03:24.860
"Okay." Roxy sighed. "I'm on my way."

